{"id": "7", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small dog sitting in a basket with a leash on the floor, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring.", "pred": "\\boxed{A chaotic, abstract visual sequence of shapes in muted colors is accompanied by rhythmic, low-frequency percussive sounds.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A chaotic, abstract visual sequence of shapes in muted colors is accompanied by rhythmic, low-frequency percussive sounds.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly moving, blurry sequence of abstract, geometric shapes in muted colors, interspersed with a series of distinct, low-frequency, rhythmic impacts that resemble a percussive or mechanical source.\nThe audio contains a consistent, rhythmic percussive sound, while the visuals show a chaotic, abstract movement of shapes.\nThe video and audio elements present a contrast: chaotic motion in visuals versus rhythmic, low-frequency impacts in sound, without direct visual confirmation of the audio source.\n\n\\boxed{A chaotic, abstract visual sequence of shapes in muted colors is accompanied by rhythmic, low-frequency percussive sounds.}", "time_sec": 62.796, "generation_time_seconds": 30.4107, "selection_time_seconds": 27.5948, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2766, 4933, 264, 3691, 4004, 10199, 448, 5257, 2613, 11, 12955, 657, 6171, 304, 2155, 7987, 323, 29853, 11, 323, 264, 8872, 7310, 4712, 5112, 374, 6617, 6814, 279, 12327, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1606, -0.1157, -0.1607, -0.029, -3.5789, -2.7012, -7.7114, -0.0, -1.1553, -2.5609, -0.0927, -3.277, -0.0024, -3.1972, -1.4283, -0.5834, -0.062, -0.615, -4.2, -0.0329, -3.2994, -1.0819, -3.4472, -0.86