{"id": "76", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of water trickling and dripping accompanies a bustling crowd's chatter, as a man captures a mesmerizing image of fish swimming in a large aquarium.", "pred": "The video displays a mosaic of textured patterns in muted colors, while the audio captures the rhythmic flow of water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays a mosaic of textured patterns in muted colors, while the audio captures the rhythmic flow of water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a mosaic of textured patterns in muted colors, while water runs down a surface in a rhythmic, soothing pattern.\nThe audio captures the rhythmic flow of water, which could imply a setting like a bathroom or kitchen.\nThe video consists of a collage of various surfaces with different textures, presented in a grid format featuring a mix of fabric-like and geometric patterns in shades of gray, blue, and beige. The audio features the sound of water flowing, creating a tranquil ambiance.\n\nThe video displays a mosaic of textured patterns in muted colors, while the audio captures the rhythmic flow of water.", "time_sec": 55.886, "generation_time_seconds": 27.1481, "selection_time_seconds": 24.8034, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2766, 4933, 264, 5827, 315, 73544, 26431, 11, 2670, 45158, 323, 55774, 12624, 11, 1393, 3015, 8473, 504, 264, 71453, 1119, 264, 19309, 13, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1053, -0.4777, -0.5818, -0.0153, -0.6755, -0.0013, -1.6272, -0.9828, -0.899, -1.5454, -0.1677, -0.1527, -1.3193, -0.0693, -0.0076, -0.3928, -0.7727, -2.7851, -1.4212, -0.0016, -0.0176, -0.1269, -0.0002, -0.112, -0.7219, -0.0005, -38.9583], "cumulative_logprob": -53.9387, "norm_logp": -1.9977, "input_len": 1260, "output_tokens": 27, "av