{"id": "82", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing background noises, a man speaks under a night sky resembling a block of cheese, with a view of the moon and stars twinkling above.", "pred": "A dark, textured surface with small white dots is shown while a man speaks in a deep, throaty voice about a constant flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A dark, textured surface with small white dots is shown while a man speaks in a deep, throaty voice about a constant flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nVisual analysis: A dark, textured surface with small white dots is shown. Audio analysis: A man speaks in a deep, throaty voice, discussing a constant flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.\nThe video shows a dark textured surface with small white dots while a man speaks in a deep, throaty voice about a constant flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.\nThe scene maintains a static view of the textured surface with white dots throughout the video. The man's speech continues without interruption, emphasizing the flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.\n\nA dark, textured surface with small white dots is shown while a man speaks in a deep, throaty voice about a constant flow of plus forty psi through a worm's voice.", "time_sec": 63.475, "generation_time_seconds": 33.1361, "selection_time_seconds": 25.8828, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 510, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 5424, 25, 576, 2766, 4933, 264, 6319, 11, 73544, 7329, 448, 2613, 11, 36967, 3100, 30994, 11, 70607, 264, 3265, 5239, 1651, 315, 264, 13055, 476, 11294, 448, 264, 5383, 315, 2613, 19766, 476, 54208, 624, 17, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 7699, 25, 576, 7699, 4419, 264, 85