{"id": "122", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a horn blares as wind gusts through the trees, accompanying the rumble of a motor vehicle engine, while a yellow bus drives down a street lined with trees and parked vehicles.", "pred": "\\boxed{The video juxtaposes urban traffic noise with abstract patterns and a tree, creating a dissonant yet visually rich scene.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{The video juxtaposes urban traffic noise with abstract patterns and a tree, creating a dissonant yet visually rich scene.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene features a collage of diverse images, including urban streets with vehicles, a close-up of a tree, and abstract patterns, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle horn being honked.\nThe video displays a mix of urban and natural scenes, with a focus on a tree and abstract designs, while the audio includes a vehicle horn.\nThe audio's vehicle horn sound contrasts with the visual collage, which includes urban and natural elements.\n\n\\boxed{The video juxtaposes urban traffic noise with abstract patterns and a tree, creating a dissonant yet visually rich scene.}", "time_sec": 56.893, "generation_time_seconds": 27.4986, "selection_time_seconds": 25.5592, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 9124, 8500, 4933, 264, 4013, 315, 61136, 11, 86095, 5335, 11, 2670, 8115, 12624, 323, 1257, 380, 7800, 20816, 11, 946, 10242, 448, 1467, 9293, 429, 4994, 25244, 95701, 323, 99055, 13, 576, 7699, 17167, 315, 264, 10581, 52760, 25240, 8110, 553, 264, 9814, 11, 17232, 3720, 20631, 20671, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0512, -2.4941, -1.9252, -0.3337, -0.2712, -1.0095, 0.0, -2.3446, -0.3323, -2.441, -0.0255, -0.6431, -0.411, -0.5297, -0.0375, -0.252, -1.5209, -0.0027, -0.0, -0.5598, -0.1097, -6.8309, -0.0635, -0.0,