{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "A person sprays paint onto a large canvas with a skull design, while a high-pitched buzzing sound is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A person sprays paint onto a large canvas with a skull design, while a high-pitched buzzing sound is heard in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content shows a blurred, abstract pattern of various shapes and colors, predominantly black, white, and shades of gray. The audio features a high-pitched, continuous buzzing sound, possibly from an electric toothbrush.\nThe audio's high-pitched, continuous buzzing does not match the visual content's abstract, static pattern, suggesting the audio may be unrelated or misaligned with the visual scene.\nThe audio's high-pitched, continuous buzzing does not match the visual content's abstract, static pattern, suggesting the audio may be unrelated or misaligned with the visual scene.\n\nA person sprays paint onto a large canvas with a skull design, while a high-pitched buzzing sound is heard in the background.", "time_sec": 58.302, "generation_time_seconds": 28.5179, "selection_time_seconds": 26.4407, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 9124, 374, 264, 51987, 5383, 315, 8115, 20816, 323, 7987, 11, 1393, 279, 7699, 374, 264, 12966, 11, 3347, 2268, 92403, 85324, 5112, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.075, -3.376, -2.7947, -0.0483, -1.1153, -3.6639, -0.0354, -0.425